  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vatten och sanitet i f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;der(PASAP),klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water &amp; Sanitation Periurban PASAP climate change - Water &amp; Sanitation Periurban PASAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r PASAP &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra f&#xf6;r fattiga         m&#xe4;nniskor som bor i periurbana omr&#xe5;den, genom fokus p&#xe5; h&#xe5;llbart       nyttjande av vattenresurser och fr&#xe4;mjande av vatten- och              sanitetsssystem som st&#xe5;r emot klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar. Det specifika m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ngen till h&#xe5;llbara vatten- och sanitetstj&#xe4;nster i    periurbana omr&#xe5;den i Bolivia som har mer &#xe4;n 10 000 inv&#xe5;nare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of PASAP is to improve the livelihoods of poor  people living in peri-urban areas, focusing on sustainable management of water resources and promoting water and sanitation systems that    are resilient to climate change. The specific objective is to         increase access to sustainable water and sanitation services in       peri-urban areas in Bolivia which have more than 10.000 inhabitants</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution began in 2012, however at the end of 2013 Sida required that all contributions are registered in TRAC</narrative>
  </description>
